{"text":"<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I6-WlTWTG5c</p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14549.687252\">4:02:29</span> ### 1-14. Kusalattika-āsavadukaṃ ^7-52-0</span><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-52a-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14557.031642\">4:02:37</span> 1. Akusalaṃ āsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52a-1 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14568.615585\">4:02:48</span> Hetuyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n(Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14580.498911\">4:03:00</span> 2. Kusalaṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo noāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kusalaṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato noāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kusalaṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo noāsavo ca abyākato noāsavo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-52a-2 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14611.178607\">4:03:31</span> Akusalaṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo noāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14621.699556\">4:03:41</span> Abyākataṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato noāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14632.019381\">4:03:52</span> Kusalaṃ noāsavañca abyākataṃ noāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato noāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14645.175301\">4:04:05</span> Akusalaṃ noāsavañca abyākataṃ noāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato noāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Ārammaṇapaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14657.154448\">4:04:17</span> 3. Kusalaṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo noāsavo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) ^7-52a-3 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14666.627921\">4:04:26</span> Akusalaṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo noāsavo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14677.667465\">4:04:37</span> Abyākataṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato noāsavo dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14687.789373\">4:04:47</span> 4. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52a-4 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14693.90585\">4:04:53</span> Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā nava…pe… novigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ).\n\n##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14705.650821\">4:05:05</span> 5. Kusalo noāsavo dhammo kusalassa noāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-52a-5 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14718.653934\">4:05:18</span> Akusalo noāsavo dhammo akusalassa noāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14727.521015\">4:05:27</span> Abyākato noāsavo dhammo abyākatassa noāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14740.481536\">4:05:40</span> Kusalo noāsavo dhammo kusalassa noāsavassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14749.306899\">4:05:49</span> 6. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā dasa…pe… avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-52a-6\n\n#### 1-15. Kusalattika-sāsavadukaṃ ^7-52b-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-52c-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14763.535684\">4:06:03</span> 7. Kusalaṃ sāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-52c-7 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14772.869928\">4:06:12</span> Akusalaṃ sāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14782.195407\">4:06:22</span> Abyākataṃ sāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14791.280604\">4:06:31</span> Kusalaṃ sāsavañca abyākataṃ sāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14801.763309\">4:06:41</span> Akusalaṃ sāsavañca abyākataṃ sāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14812.651305\">4:06:52</span> 8. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52c-8 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14817.578714\">4:06:57</span> Nahetuyā dve, naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14827.420168\">4:07:07</span> 9. Kusalo sāsavo dhammo kusalassa sāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-52c-9 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14836.05004\">4:07:16</span> Akusalo sāsavo dhammo akusalassa sāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14845.48243\">4:07:25</span> Abyākato sāsavo dhammo abyākatassa sāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14854.682108\">4:07:34</span> Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### Anāsavapadaṃ ^7-52d-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-52e-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14866.247781\">4:07:46</span><span> 10. Kusalaṃ anāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo anāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-52e-10 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14878.643113\">4:07:58</span><span> Abyākataṃ anāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato anāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14887.864786\">4:08:07</span><span> 11. Hetuyā dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-52e-11 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetuārammaṇapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14896.520951\">4:08:16</span><span> 12. Kusalo anāsavo dhammo kusalassa anāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-52e-12 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14904.279416\">4:08:24</span><span> Abyākato anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa anāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14913.369164\">4:08:33</span><span> Abyākato anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa anāsavassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato anāsavo dhammo kusalassa anāsavassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14932.553739\">4:08:52</span><span> Kusalo anāsavo dhammo kusalassa anāsavassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14941.302678\">4:09:01</span><span> Abyākato anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa anāsavassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Abyākato anāsavo dhammo kusalassa anāsavassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14958.979175\">4:09:18</span><span> Kusalo anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa anāsavassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14967.927972\">4:09:27</span><span> Abyākato anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa anāsavassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"14977.46189\">4:09:37</span><span> 13. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve, aññamaññe dve, nissaye dve, upanissaye cattāri…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-52e-13 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-16. Kusalattika-āsavasampayuttadukaṃ ^7-52f-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15003.779584\">4:10:03</span><span> 14. Akusalaṃ āsavasampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo āsavasampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52f-14 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15018.065086\">4:10:18</span><span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, āmammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15029.654746\">4:10:29</span><span> 15. Kusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo āsavavippayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo āsavavippayutto ca abyākato āsavavippayutto ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-52f-15 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15064.242043\">4:11:04</span><span> Akusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15074.578106\">4:11:14</span><span> Abyākataṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15085.690797\">4:11:25</span><span> Kusalaṃ āsavavippayuttañca abyākataṃ āsavavippayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15099.889056\">4:11:39</span><span> Akusalaṃ āsavavippayuttañca abyākataṃ āsavavippayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15113.909608\">4:11:53</span><span> 16. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā satta…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52f-16\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15125.797199\">4:12:05</span><span> 17. Kusalo āsavavippayutto dhammo kusalassa āsavavippayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-52f-17 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15140.243139\">4:12:20</span><span> Akusalo āsavavippayutto dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15150.459253\">4:12:30</span><span> Abyākato āsavavippayutto dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)\n\n18. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā pañca…pe… avigate dasa (saṃkhittaṃ.) ^7-52f-18\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-17. Kusalattika-āsavasāsavadukaṃ ^7-52g-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-52h-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo</span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15183.929653\">4:13:03</span><span> 19. Akusalaṃ āsavañceva sāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo āsavo ceva sāsavo ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52h-19 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15196.272731\">4:13:16</span><span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15208.743201\">4:13:28</span><span> 20. Kusalaṃ sāsavañceva no ca āsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-52h-20 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15221.986888\">4:13:41</span><span> Akusalaṃ sāsavañceva no ca āsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15238.777888\">4:13:58</span><span> Abyākataṃ sāsavañceva no ca āsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15252.018586\">4:14:12</span><span> Kusalaṃ sāsavañceva no ca āsavañca abyākataṃ sāsavañceva no ca āsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15268.583374\">4:14:28</span><span> Akusalaṃ sāsavañceva no ca āsavañca abyākataṃ sāsavañceva no ca āsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15284.95466\">4:14:44</span><span> 21. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52h-21\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15297.360367\">4:14:57</span><span> 22. Kusalo sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo dhammo kusalassa sāsavassa ceva no ca āsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-52h-22 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15313.241328\">4:15:13</span><span> Akusalo sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo dhammo akusalassa sāsavassa ceva no ca āsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15326.404834\">4:15:26</span><span> Abyākato sāsavo ceva no ca āsavo dhammo abyākatassa sāsavassa ceva no ca āsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15340.245582\">4:15:40</span><span> 23. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā nava…pe… avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-52h-23 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-18. Kusalattika-āsavaāsavasampayuttadukaṃ ^7-52i-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-52j-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15353.298791\">4:15:53</span><span> 24. Akusalaṃ āsavañceva āsavasampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo āsavo ceva āsavasampayutto ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52j-24 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15366.820959\">4:16:06</span><span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15379.244311\">4:16:19</span><span> 25. Akusalaṃ āsavasampayuttañceva no ca āsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo āsavasampayutto ceva no ca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52j-25 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15393.327432\">4:16:33</span><span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārepi…pe… sampayuttavārepi pañhāvārepi sabbattha ekaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15405.739207\">4:16:45</span><span> 26. Kusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-52j-26</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15418.323404\">4:16:58</span><span> Akusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15431.105784\">4:17:11</span><span> Abyākataṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15448.96769\">4:17:28</span><span> Kusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavañca abyākataṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15468.863717\">4:17:48</span><span> Akusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavañca abyākataṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ sāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15490.494675\">4:18:10</span><span> 27. Hetuyā satta, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate satta (saṃkhittaṃ. Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ). ^7-52j-27 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15501.52471\">4:18:21</span><span> 28. Kusalo āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo kusalassa āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-52j-28 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15513.430443\">4:18:33</span><span> Akusalo āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15526.666191\">4:18:46</span><span> Abyākato āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa sāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15539.831852\">4:18:59</span><span> 29. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā cattāri…pe… avigate dasa (saṃkhittaṃ. Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ). ^7-52j-29 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-19. Kusalattika-āsavavippayuttasāsavadukaṃ ^7-52k-0</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-52l-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15553.48115\">4:19:13</span><span> 30. Kusalaṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ anāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-52l-30</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15568.991466\">4:19:28</span><span> Abyākataṃ āsavavippayuttaṃ anāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15581.972471\">4:19:41</span><span> 31. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52l-31\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetuārammaṇapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15592.200434\">4:19:52</span><span> 32. Kusalo āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo kusalassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-52l-32 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15603.62936\">4:20:03</span><span> Abyākato āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15616.110088\">4:20:16</span><span> Abyākato āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15629.196135\">4:20:29</span><span> Abyākato āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo kusalassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15641.448843\">4:20:41</span><span> Kusalo āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo kusalassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15652.945098\">4:20:52</span><span> Abyākato āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15666.010007\">4:21:06</span><span> Abyākato āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo kusalassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15677.830631\">4:21:17</span><span> Kusalo āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15690.343102\">4:21:30</span><span> Abyākato āsavavippayutto anāsavo dhammo abyākatassa āsavavippayuttassa anāsavassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15707.386876\">4:21:47</span><span> 33. Hetuyā dve, ārammaṇe dve, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare dve, samanantare dve, sahajāte dve, aññamaññe dve, nissaye dve, upanissaye cattāri…pe… avigate dve (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-52l-33 </span></p><p></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15723.756064\">4:22:03</span><span> (Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15733.708056\">4:22:13</span><span> Kusalattikaāsavagocchakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>##### 1-20-54. Kusalattika-saññojanādidukāni</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15749.483895\">4:22:29</span> 34. Akusalaṃ saññojanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… akusalaṃ ganthaṃ… oghaṃ… yogaṃ… nīvaraṇaṃ…. ^7-52l-34 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15760.594151\">4:22:40</span> Kusalaṃ noparāmāsaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo noparāmāso dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (Āsavagocchakasadisaṃ.) Diṭṭhiṃ paṭicca diṭṭhi na uppajjati.\n\nKusalattike cha gocchakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.\n</span></p>","media-time":14568.615585}